  "question": {
    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;be solution of the differential equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.&nbsp;If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></math>,&nbsp;then the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to:"
  },
